<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="https://8364161484.mortgage-application.net/WebApp/Start.aspx"><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Graham Parham's contact info</font>&nbsp;</a></b>below and complete the application. Graham's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Ashley</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;">Graham W. Parham<u></u><u></u></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><i><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;">Senior Loan Officer<u></u><u></u></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(